00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.100
Well, what do ya think?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.400
Probably won't get stage fright here.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.480
Don't pressure him, moron.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.060
Don't make him think about it.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.270
I'm fine today...

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.900
Kuroba.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.100
Over there.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:58.190
Fukuho.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:03.100
If you're going to find
something out by going over there,

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.560
then we're gonna go.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.270
Let's win, Haijima.

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:24.730
Of course. Fukuho for us is just a checkpoint.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:26.900
Our goal...

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.310
...is getting to the Spring Tournament.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:33.650
We're gonna stand on that center court.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.810
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.190
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:45.150
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

