00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.850
<i>What should we do?</i>
<i>We're not used to facing adversity</i>

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:04.980
<i>So our resolve's definitely not all there</i>

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.400
<i>Back then, we were just</i>

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.730
<i>Envious of others and</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:14.440
<i>Angry at something we couldn't see</i>

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.980
<i>We just kept glaring at the next step</i>

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.350
<i>That we could've easily taken</i>

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:24.310
<i>And it was eating away at us silently</i>

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:28.100
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.520
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:35.440
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:40.230
<i>Even though we're so frail we might break,</i>
<i>we still continued to seek love</i>

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:45.350
<i>We don't want to forget the reason</i>
<i>we're standing on this stage</i>

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:50.150
<i>Because you're the one who made me stronger</i>

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:54.600
<i>I give you this lovely ballad</i>
<i>within this beautiful attack</i>

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:09.750
Episode 8: 'Yuni and Chika Re-enter the Battle'

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.980
Once the teams from the third match move,
we can go on the practice courts.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.400
We're gonna have an early lunch before that.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.480
Make sure you don't get full.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.810
Especially Okuma and Kuroba.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.850
Why are you calling us out?

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:21.560
The weather report said it's gonna be hot,

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.520
so this might be our
roughest tournament this year.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.060
No one's sick, are they?

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.060
No, sir!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.600
Haijima, you good?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.770
I am.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.190
In that case...

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:39.230
I was told to tell you guys the starting
lineup for our first match here.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.400
The starting lineup will be...

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.190
Aoki, Kanno, Uchimura,

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:52.310
Okuma, Haijima, and Kuroba.
We're going with you six.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:53.770
Hokao's gonna be our libero.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.810
I'd like you to sit out
the match against Fukuho.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.400
Haijima. Let me answer your question later.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.980
I don't know the answer right now.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:10.270
I want to be absolutely sure
when I give you my answer.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.350
Uchimura, I know it's been a while
since you were on starting lineup,

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.270
but I'm counting on you.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:21.270
Right. I'll try to keep up
until you get added back in!

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.270
You don't need to get that worked up.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:27.690
We're up against Ikeda Biz. We were able
to beat them with last year's team.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:30.810
We're switching out the
rotation with Kuroba and I.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:33.230
Kanno, Haijima, I'm expecting
you to back them up.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.100
Yes, sir.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.000
Kuroba.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.730
Yes?

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:39.650
Could you at least act like this concerns you?

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:42.810
Your cross shot will get us the most points.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.810
You need to make sure you keep working
whether you're up front or in the back.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.900
There's no time to daydream.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.940
Y-Yes, sir. I know.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:54.600
You're Seiin's ace, Yuni Kuroba.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.520
We're counting on you.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.940
Right!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:05.240
Preliminaries Round 2 - Match 4

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:05.240
Preliminaries Round 2 - Match 4

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.770
Let them see just how much
we've been practicing!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:08.600
Let's go!

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.350
Yeah!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.100
Hey, first year.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.980
I'm sure you're happy you got your way.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:23.060
Though I can't say that just switching Oda
out with Uchimura was the right answer.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.770
If you're willing to put others on the line,

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:28.060
you've gotta put yourself on the line, too.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.230
What's that mean?

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.480
Haijima?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.520
We're going to attack from
the back line on the first one.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.520
Make sure you stuff them.

