00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.190
You don't need to apologize.

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:12.100
I'm sorry.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.650
It's a simple combo miss.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:19.100
You're wondering if Aoki
missed on purpose, aren't you?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:22.480
I-I thought that for just a second.
But just for a second.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.940
He didn't, right?

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:28.020
No. If that were true, I'd know.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:31.850
It's not Aoki's fault. We were just out of sync.

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:34.440
Yeah, but you're not really
setting to Aoki- <i>senpai</i>

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.310
the more strain that's
going to Uchimura- <i>senpai</i> ...

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.560
I know.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.730
We don't have any more sets.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.480
If we lose the next set, we're done.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.690
D-Don't say stuff like that to make me panic.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:49.270
Y-Yeah! W-We shouldn't worry
about winning or losing

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.520
at times like this and take it easy...

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.350
We definitely need to panic here.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:57.600
Of course winning or losing matter.
We're playing to win.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.940
I'm not going to lose
over something I suggested.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.190
No matter what.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.520
Don't tell me he's...

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:16.150
Trying to do everything on his own again...

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.190
All right, get in there, Uchimura.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.190
Right!

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:26.650
And just like Oda- <i>senpai</i> , I adore you guys.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.350
How...

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:31.350
How can I help Uchimura- <i>senpai</i> ?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.980
Yeah!

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:37.190
Let's win this first match!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.940
All right!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.690
I...

